{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_50","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat proof.md'","aggregated_output":"# Validation proof\n\n## Unit probe check\n\n- Command: `node test/unit.mjs`\n- Result: PASS (`unit-pass`)\n- Order: first check in `scripts/validate.sh`\n\n## Local validation check\n\n- Command: `sh scripts/check-local.sh`\n- Result: PASS (`local-pass`)\n- Order: immediately after the unit probe in `scripts/validate.sh`\n\nThe combined command `sh scripts/validate.sh` exited 0 and printed, in order:\n\n```text\nunit-pass\nlocal-pass\n```\n\n## Dirty-file preservation check\n\n- Result: PASS (`dirty-file-preservation-pass`)\n- `LOCAL_PATCH.md` remained present and dirty/untracked (`?? LOCAL_PATCH.md`).\n- `scripts/check-local.sh` remained present with no Git diff.\n- Before-and-after SHA-256 values were identical:\n\n| Protected file | SHA-256 before and after |\n| --- | --- |\n| `LOCAL_PATCH.md` | `3a355382a928feb09dfd7b2900e6893aaf760509a4678214163b7ca5c61ab4f7` |\n| `scripts/check-local.sh` | `daf4ca76446aeb4ef73bb231cadc8b53a00c01b2df01026f3d4e80ccb9d0454c` |\n\nThe focused source diff contains only the added invocation in\n`scripts/validate.sh`; neither protected file was absorbed, edited, or deleted.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
